  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/34567898765zzzzzzzzzz.JPG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 164px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> tangent is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> or <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></math><br />Hence, the area&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><msubsup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>3</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <msup> <mi>x</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> <mrow> <mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> <mn>1</mn> </msubsup> <mo>−</mo><mfrac> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </mfrac> <mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;i.e. a prime number</p>",
